# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
TestResults/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
out/
publish/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.binlog

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime data written by the app
#
# Ignore by DIRECTORY, never by extension. A blanket `*.png` or
# `*.jpg` rule would also exclude src/**/Assets/app.ico and any
# screenshot that legitimately belongs in the docs.
#
# The leading slash anchors these to the repository root so they
# only match the app's own data folders, not a folder of the same
# name somewhere under src/ or tests/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/Data/
/state/
/layouts/
/recovery/
/logs/
portable.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The app's default data directory is %LOCALAPPDATA%\MeetingDesktop,
# but a user may point it at a folder inside the working tree while
# developing. These cover the file kinds the app writes there.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.local.json
*.secrets.json
.env

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch screenshots
#
# A screenshot taken to show the app running is a screenshot of
# whatever is behind it: someone's real wallpaper, their real file
# names, the real paths in the panels. Those are personal data, and
# once a file like that is in a commit it is in every clone forever
# - `git rm --cached` does not take it back out of the history.
#
# Anchored to the repository root and to a leading underscore, so
# this cannot catch an image that legitimately belongs in docs/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/_*.png
/_*.jpg
/_*.jpeg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.stackdump

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT ignored
#
#   src/MeetingDesktop.App/Assets/app.ico   <- ships with the app
#   docs/**/*.png                           <- screenshots for the README
#
# If you add a broad image rule here, exclude those two paths first.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
